 "nl": [
  "No packet from ntp-servers may enter guest-wifi, even for services open to everyone.",
  "Make DNS over UDP 53 on dns-servers reachable from all internal zones.",
  "Allow scada to connect to vpn-users using SNMP (UDP 161) and MySQL (TCP 3306) and RDP (TCP 3389).",
  "Hosts in library may reach dns-servers over SMB (TCP 445) and LDAP (TCP 389) and SSH (TCP 22).",
  "finance offers HTTP (TCP 80) to every zone.",
  "Block FTP (TCP 21) from vpn-users to library; the rest of any TCP port between them is allowed.",
  "vpn-users must accept PostgreSQL (TCP 5432) from dns-servers.",
  "Apart from ntp-servers on DNS over UDP 53, all traffic originating in vpn-users must be dropped."
 ],
